            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Guests?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772150109"
            ]
          },
          "772150109": {
            "id": "772150109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Myeshskaya",
            "text": "Yes. I'm from the House of Hesperides in the mountains. That's the residence of Lady Pavlina, princess of the Snegovik, and other fae...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772150110"
            ]
          },
          "772150110": {
            "id": "772150110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Myeshskaya",
            "text": "And now, we're looking for... exalted guests to attend the princess's wedding. That's why I've been sent down here to look for the most suitable and worthy individuals...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772150111"
            ]
          },
          "772150111": {
            "id": "772150111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Myeshskaya",
            "text": "The two of you certainly seem to fit that criterion, what with your extraordinary temperaments and dress. I wonder if we may have the honor of hosting you at the House?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772150112"
            ]
          },
          "772150112": {
            "id": "772150112",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So, you mean to say, you want to invite us to this princess's wedding? \"Pavlina\"... she sounds like a Snegurochka.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772150113"
            ]
          },
          "772150113": {
            "id": "772150113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Myeshskaya",
            "text": "That is entirely correct, little minion.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772150114"
            ]
          },
          "772150114": {
            "id": "772150114",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Tsk, Paimon already told you, Paimon's not a minion... But you know, {NICKNAME}, from what Paimon has heard, here in Snezhnaya a love marriage between a Snegovik and a human isn't all that common...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772150115"
            ]
          },
          "772150115": {
            "id": "772150115",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Much less a wedding involving a Snegovik princess. This could turn out to be real interesting...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772150116"
            ]
          },
          "772150116": {
            "id": "772150116",
            "speakerId": 22280,
            "speakerName": "Eye of Graeae",
            "text": "Pavlina...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772150117"
            ]
          },
          "772150117": {
            "id": "772150117",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm? What is it, Goggles?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772150118"
            ]
          },
          "772150118": {
            "id": "772150118",
            "speakerId": 22280,
            "speakerName": "Eye of Graeae",
            "text": "The name... feels a little familiar. It comes up when I do a search of my memories.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772150119"
            ]
          },
          "772150119": {
            "id": "772150119",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh? Could this princess have anything to do with Goggles then...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772150120"
            ]
          },
          "772150120": {
            "id": "772150120",
            "speakerId": 22280,
            "speakerName": "Eye of Graeae",
            "text": "That is highly possible.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772150121"
            ]
          },
          "772150121": {
            "id": "772150121",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Great! Then we definitely have to go then!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772150122"
            ]
          },
          "772150122": {
            "id": "772150122",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah! Even if we don't end up finding what Goggles is looking for, it's gonna be fun anyway!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772150123"
            ]
          },
          "772150123": {
            "id": "772150123",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So... Um... Miss. How do we get to that wedding, then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772150124"
            ]
          },
          "772150124": {
            "id": "772150124",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Myeshskaya",
            "text": "It will be our utmost pleasure to welcome you at the wedding... Take this invite, please. All you have to do is show the invite when you arrive at the House of Hesperides...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772150125"
            ]
          },
          "772150125": {
            "id": "772150125",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Myeshskaya",
            "text": "Although I'd dearly love to travel with you, I have yet to complete the task Lady Pavlina has given me...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772150126"
            ]
          },
          "772150126": {
            "id": "772150126",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's fine. We'll find our way to that... um... whatever house you were talking about! That name's too darn long!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "772150127"
            ]
          },
          "772150127": {
            "id": "772150127",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Myeshskaya",
            "text": "Heh. I wish the both you a most pleasant time at the House, then..."
          }
        }
      }
